@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@showId = 1
@sessionId = 1
@ticketCategoryId = 2
@idNo = 110101199001011234

### 0.1 用户登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000001",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("userToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 0.2 管理员登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000002",
  "password": "Test123456"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 0.3 预热票档库存
### Purchase Plan 完成阶段不占库存，但开售后的 submit 会进入真实 Redis 预扣链路。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/ticket-categories/{{ticketCategoryId}}/stock/preheat
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 1. 创建实名观演人
### 若固定证件号已存在，请替换 @idNo。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/audiences
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "张三",
  "idType": "ID_CARD",
  "idNo": "{{idNo}}"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("audienceId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 2. 创建预约计划；此时不占库存
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "defaultAudienceIds": [{{audienceId}}]
}

> {%
  client.global.set("planId", response.body.data.id);
  client.global.set("planVersion", response.body.data.version);
%}

### 3. 设置场次、票档和数量
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/spec
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "version": {{planVersion}}
}

> {%
  client.global.set("planVersion", response.body.data.version);
%}

### 4. 明确完成预约；只冻结方案和观演人快照，不占库存
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": {{planVersion}}
}

> {%
  client.global.set("planVersion", response.body.data.version);
%}

### 5. 到达 saleStartTime 后进入 Waiting Room
### docs/sql/data.sql 当前样例场次用于“开售前预约”演示；若本地时间尚未进入销售窗口，
### 请使用后台接口创建/调整一个已开售场次，或在仅用于本地测试的数据中调整 sale_start_time / sale_end_time。
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/waiting-room/queue?ticketCategoryId={{ticketCategoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 6. 管理员放行并发放 admissionToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/ops/waiting-room/admission-batches?ticketCategoryId={{ticketCategoryId}}&count=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {%
  client.global.set("admissionToken", response.body.data[0].token);
%}

### 7. 获取一次性幂等 Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

> {%
  client.global.set("idempotencyToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 8. 手动提交预约抢票
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-plans/{{planId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": {{planVersion}},
  "idempotencyToken": "{{idempotencyToken}}",
  "admissionToken": "{{admissionToken}}"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("requestId", response.body.data.requestId);
%}

### 9. 查询异步创单结果
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/order-requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 10. 查询预约计划状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/purchase-plans/{{planId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 说明
### READY / SUBMITTING / RECONCILIATION_REQUIRED 状态下不要换 Token 盲目重提。
### 预约只是开售前填单方案，不保证库存、价格或最终抢票成功。
